        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram - Quản lý Khen thưởng\n\n&#39; Cấu hình giao diện chuẩn UML\nskinparam sequenceMessageAlign left\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam maxMessageSize 150\n\nactor \&quot;Trưởng phòng / HR\&quot; as HR\nboundary \&quot;FormKhenThuong\&quot; as Form\ncontrol \&quot;KhenThuongControl\&quot; as Control\nentity \&quot;qd:QuyetDinhKTKL\&quot; as QD\nentity \&quot;phieu:PhieuThuChiKTKL\&quot; as Phieu\nentity \&quot;bl:BangLuongThang\&quot; as BL\n\nautonumber\n\nHR -&gt; Form : MoFormKhenThuong()\nHR -&gt; Form : ChonDoiTuong(CaNhan / TapThe)\nHR -&gt; Form : NhapThongTinKT(soTien, lyDo)\nHR -&gt; Form : Click \&quot;Lưu Quyết Định\&quot;\n\nForm -&gt; Control : taoQD(thongTinKT)\nactivate Control\n\nControl -&gt; QD : create(soQD, loaiQD, doiTuong, soTien, lyDo)\nactivate QD\nQD --&gt; Control : maQDKTKL\ndeactivate QD\n\nControl -&gt; Phieu : taoPhieuChi(maQDKTKL, soTien)\nactivate Phieu\nPhieu --&gt; Control : maPhieuTC\ndeactivate Phieu\n\nControl -&gt; BL : capNhatTienThuongIntoLuong(maNV/maPB, soTien)\nactivate BL\nBL --&gt; Control : ThanhCong\ndeactivate BL\n\nControl --&gt; Form : ThongBaoThanhCong\ndeactivate Control\n\nForm --&gt; HR : HienThiKetQua()\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="IZ1ON1xt5I79AfkXmxtF-1">
